                                "sense_id": "52862149-f96e-35c5-9fef-a34dd8ad814a",
                                "text": "No UK company responded, believing that the availability requirement could not be reached in British operating conditions. But General Motors thought otherwise, offering its SD40-2 design. However, to make it fit the UK loading gauge, considerable redesign was required."
                            }
                        ]
